00:06:28,235 --> 00:06:34,235
The Gods need a hero.

2
00:12:56,470 --> 00:13:02,470
Immortals is a fantasy, action, drama film directed by Tarsem Singh.

3
00:19:24,705 --> 00:19:30,705
Theseus is a mortal man chosen by Zeus to lead the fight against the ruthless King Hyperion,
who is on a rampage across Greece to obtain a weapon that can destroy humanity.

4
00:25:52,941 --> 00:25:58,941
Theseus, played by Henry Cavill.

5
00:32:21,176 --> 00:32:27,176
King Hyperion, played by Mickey Rourke.

6
00:38:49,411 --> 00:38:55,411
Stavros, played by Stephen Dorff.

7
00:45:17,647 --> 00:45:23,647
Phaedra, played by Freida Pinto.

8
00:51:45,882 --> 00:51:51,882
Zeus, played by Luke Evans.

9
00:58:14,117 --> 00:58:20,117
Old Zeus, played by John Hurt.

10
01:04:42,352 --> 01:04:48,352
Immortals is a 2011 American epic fantasy action film directed by Tarsem Singh Dhandwar and starring Henry Cavill,
Stephen Dorff, Luke Evans, Isabel Lucas, John Hurt, Kellan Lutz, Freida Pinto, and Mickey Rourke.

11
01:11:10,588 --> 01:11:16,588
Loosely based on the Greek myths of Theseus and the Minotaur, and the Titanomachy, the film was
previously named Dawn of War and War of the Gods before being renamed Immortals.

12
01:17:38,823 --> 01:17:44,823
Principal photography began in Montreal on April 5, 2010.

13
01:24:07,058 --> 01:24:13,058
Immortals premiered in Los Angeles on November 8 and was released in the
United States on November 11, 2011, by Relativity Media.

14
01:30:35,294 --> 01:30:41,294
The film was a commercial success, grossing $227 million,
and received mixed reviews from critics.

15
01:37:03,529 --> 01:37:09,529
The film explores themes of army, poison, mythology, zeus, sword fight.

16
01:43:31,764 --> 01:43:37,764
The tone is emotional.
